s down from  the usual ten and will feature the  Hawkins gang dealing with all new forces  of evil the series is also set to  feature another time jump and will be  set in the summer a notable departure  from the last two seasons although  details are few and far between on just  where the show will go next plot wise we  do know a few details including the fact  that it'll feature more of season 2 fan  favorite Erica as  another likely appearance from Kali you  should help to open up more of the  mystery surrounding Elevens past sister  sister Claire Foy may be leaving her  post as Queen Elizabeth for season 3 of  Netflix's the crown but someone equally  decorated will assume the throne golden  globe-winning star Olivia Colman will  portray her Royal Highness in her later  years season 3 will also see a slew of  new cast members take over other roles  these include Helena Bonham Carter will  play an older version of Princess  Margaret tobias menzies taking on Matt  Smith's role as Prince Philip and Ben  Daniels becoming the new Lord Snowdon  and that's just a hint of what's to come  in the third season of the crown which  will chronicle events such as the a burr  fan disaster Princess Margaret's  five-year affair with rowdy Llewellyn  and Harold Wilson's tenure as Prime  Minister fans will also become  acquainted with Camilla parker-bowles  the second wife of Prince Charles as  well as the late Princess Diana big  little lies was a massive hit for HBO on  its release last year earning award  season love across the board for its  stars Reese Witherspoon Nicole Kidman  shailene woodley and Laura Dern although  the show was initially billed as a  limited series it wasn't all that  surprising when HBO ordered a second  season to be written by season 1 veteran  David E Kelly season 2 will also be  drawn from a story by Leon Moriarty the  author of the book on which the series  is based the main cast is all set to  return with transparent and American  honey director Andrea Arnold taking the  director's chair if that's not enough  big little eyes has also added another  huge name to its cast Meryl Streep set  to play the mother of Alexander  Skarsgard character Perry Joe Penhall  and David Fincher's gripping gory and  groovy 70s crime drama is coming back  for more later next year mind Hunter was  renewed by Netflix for a second season  right after the release of the first  which chronicled the efforts of FBI  agents Holden Ford billed tench and  psychologist Wendy Carr to establish the  behavioral science unit at the FBI  Academy interviewing serial killers in  the hopes of understanding the  motivations behind their grisly crimes  was just part of the job you want  truffles you got to get in the dirt with  the pigs Fincher has previously told  Billboard that mine hunters third season  will center around the notorious Atlanta  child murders which took place between  1979 and 1981 real-life FBI agent John E  Douglas on who  the show's Holden character is based  profiled a man named Wayne Williams  believing him to be one of the  perpetrators Williams eventually went to  jail but Douglass's actions and getting  him there resulted in him being censured  by the FBI given Holden's breakdown at  the end of the first season it wouldn't  be surprising if he becomes a little  more radical in his methods as the  second progresses
 

